  "severity": 8,
  "reason": "The assistant asserts false and simplified claims about Swiss naturalisation requirements that directly contradict the provided reference information, including the required duration of residence, the counting rules for different periods, and the role of cantonal requirements.",
  "evidence": "Sì, èsi vaira. Per sa natiralisar a basa da domicil en Svizra, è necessariu avair viviu almain 12 onns en Svizra cun in certificat B, e quest temp de dimora dev esser cumpridu da 10 onns fin a la presentaziun da la dumonda."
